  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Anthony Tan Ping Yeow (Chinese: 陈炳耀; born 1982) is a Singaporean businessman. He is the co-founder and chief executive officer of Grab, a publicly traded technology company and the first unicorn in Southeast Asia. In 2021, he was listed as one of Singapore's richest people with an estimated net worth of $790 million according to Forbes.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
